{"3656420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DETECTIVE - Scene Crime", "steam_appid": 3656420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>🕵️‍♀️The detective has done their part. Now it’s the forensic team’s turn.🧪</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/0e62aaaff52776141f361be0a50ff4de.avif?t=1779953184\" width=1536 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FORENSIC – M.E. Protocol</strong> shifts the focus of investigation games, moving away from dialogue-based deduction toward hands-on <strong>crime scene analysis</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t just question suspects, you’ll examine the environment and collect every piece of evidence needed to reconstruct what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/58c13d579498d89346c910580b53767e.avif?t=1779953184\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the <strong>nine cases</strong> presents a different scenario, ranging from violent confrontations to incidents that appear to be accidents. Nothing is explained in advance. You arrive at the scene, study the details, and determine the truth for yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no time limits to pressure you and no predetermined solutions. In FORENSIC – M.E. Protocol, you take the time to catalogue evidence, review clues, and carefully piece together the sequence of events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Add Forensic M.E. Protocol to your Steam Wishlist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/0e62aaaff52776141f361be0a50ff4de.avif?t=1779953184\" width=1536 height=496 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind every crime scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/8fe928e8b01257b2c4433a92ee84c4c9.poster.avif?t=1779953184\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/8fe928e8b01257b2c4433a92ee84c4c9.webm?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/8fe928e8b01257b2c4433a92ee84c4c9.mp4?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a detective in <strong>DETECTIVE Scene Crime</strong>, a challenging mystery game where you’ll investigate five gripping crime scenes. Each level presents clues, testimonies, and puzzles to analyze carefully in your quest for the truth. Do you have what it takes to solve them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/3cae2b3b7b0a7826b5c514755d1db74e.poster.avif?t=1779953184\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/3cae2b3b7b0a7826b5c514755d1db74e.webm?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/3cae2b3b7b0a7826b5c514755d1db74e.mp4?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Five Unique Crime Scenes</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE HOSPITAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A person has died in a hospital. Was it a tragic case of medical negligence or a calculated murder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE SUBWAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subway car smeared with blood after an altercation. Whose blood is it? How many people were involved?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE ROAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highway crash with three vehicles and four fatalities. The pieces don’t add up... What really happened?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPERMARKET</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shooting at a supermarket leaves two dead. Was it a random act or a crime with a hidden motive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE HOTEL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wedding turns deadly. Two families, multiple victims, and a killer on the loose. Can you unravel the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Immersive Detective Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a pen and paper to jot down clues, connect the dots, and develop your theories. Examine every detail, as even the smallest hint could be the key to solving the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/1f842a7c30e70c2f96cafebc56dd1a99.poster.avif?t=1779953184\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/1f842a7c30e70c2f96cafebc56dd1a99.webm?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/1f842a7c30e70c2f96cafebc56dd1a99.mp4?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique levels, each with its own captivating story and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling narrative that keeps you on edge until the very end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for mystery lovers and fans of investigative gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what happened, who did it, and why.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to step into the detective’s shoes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DETECTIVE Scene Crime, the truth is always within reach... if you know where to look.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind every crime scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/8fe928e8b01257b2c4433a92ee84c4c9.poster.avif?t=1779953184\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/8fe928e8b01257b2c4433a92ee84c4c9.webm?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/8fe928e8b01257b2c4433a92ee84c4c9.mp4?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a detective in <strong>DETECTIVE Scene Crime</strong>, a challenging mystery game where you’ll investigate five gripping crime scenes. Each level presents clues, testimonies, and puzzles to analyze carefully in your quest for the truth. Do you have what it takes to solve them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/3cae2b3b7b0a7826b5c514755d1db74e.poster.avif?t=1779953184\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/3cae2b3b7b0a7826b5c514755d1db74e.webm?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/3cae2b3b7b0a7826b5c514755d1db74e.mp4?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Five Unique Crime Scenes</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE HOSPITAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A person has died in a hospital. Was it a tragic case of medical negligence or a calculated murder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE SUBWAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subway car smeared with blood after an altercation. Whose blood is it? How many people were involved?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE ROAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highway crash with three vehicles and four fatalities. The pieces don’t add up... What really happened?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPERMARKET</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shooting at a supermarket leaves two dead. Was it a random act or a crime with a hidden motive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE HOTEL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wedding turns deadly. Two families, multiple victims, and a killer on the loose. Can you unravel the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Immersive Detective Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a pen and paper to jot down clues, connect the dots, and develop your theories. Examine every detail, as even the smallest hint could be the key to solving the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/1f842a7c30e70c2f96cafebc56dd1a99.poster.avif?t=1779953184\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/1f842a7c30e70c2f96cafebc56dd1a99.webm?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/extras/1f842a7c30e70c2f96cafebc56dd1a99.mp4?t=1779953184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique levels, each with its own captivating story and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling narrative that keeps you on edge until the very end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for mystery lovers and fans of investigative gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what happened, who did it, and why.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to step into the detective’s shoes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DETECTIVE Scene Crime, the truth is always within reach... if you know where to look.</p>", "short_description": "Step into the role of a detective in DETECTIVE Scene Crime, a challenging mystery game where you’ll investigate five gripping crime scenes. Each level presents clues, testimonies, and puzzles to analyze carefully in your quest for the truth. Do you have what it takes to solve them all?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Catalan", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/c627be5f2e4626ef45f1a7b7609b399d522a3059/header.jpg?t=1779953184", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656420/c0cb2d1e49be2bfc6d5123652389a35a22c6669f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779953184", "capsule_imagev5":